    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655010/extras/1d69590be9662283ec9157c06a0ab1af.avif?t=1748787445\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>wander, daydream, and explore void amongst stars and creatures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>[ VOID ]</i>, you are Mee \u2014 a small creature born into a land with no instructions, no memories, and no clear path forward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world bends and shifts with your touch, revealing secrets hidden not in words, but in movement, sound, and quiet moments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step forward is a step inward, as the mysteries you uncover mirror the ones you carry inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Endings, Only Journeys</strong><br>There are no fail states, and no clear finish line. [ VOID ] is a looping world where wandering is the destination \u2014 and understanding comes slowly, softly, in your own time.<br>To fully immerse yourself in its rhythm, we recommend using a game controller.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beneath the quiet soil, behind the drifting shadows,</i><br><i>the world hums a song meant only for you. </i>  <br><i>Not in words, not in light. </i>  <br><i>But in the spaces between.</i><br><i>Will you step closer to hear it?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655010/extras/5e5c7e6bbc922928f584b5643025e9ca.avif?t=1748787445\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655010/extras/1d69590be9662283ec9157c06a0ab1af.avif?t=1748787445\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>wander, daydream, and explore void amongst stars and creatures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>[ VOID ]</i>, you are Mee \u2014 a small creature born into a land with no instructions, no memories, and no clear path forward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world bends and shifts with your touch, revealing secrets hidden not in words, but in movement, sound, and quiet moments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step forward is a step inward, as the mysteries you uncover mirror the ones you carry inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Endings, Only Journeys</strong><br>There are no fail states, and no clear finish line. [ VOID ] is a looping world where wandering is the destination \u2014 and understanding comes slowly, softly, in your own time.<br>To fully immerse yourself in its rhythm, we recommend using a game controller.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beneath the quiet soil, behind the drifting shadows,</i><br><i>the world hums a song meant only for you. </i>  <br><i>Not in words, not in light. </i>  <br><i>But in the spaces between.</i><br><i>Will you step closer to hear it?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655010/extras/5e5c7e6bbc922928f584b5643025e9ca.avif?t=1748787445\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p>",
